1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,873
Welcome to PLUTÓN ACADEMIC.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:05,350
Here is how to start learning.

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:09,489
On the home page, select Sign in

4
00:00:09,589 --> 00:00:12,350
and enter your email and password.

5
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:16,591
In My platform, you can see your account,

6
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:20,350
your recorded membership and your overall
progress.

7
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:23,351
Open My courses or Lessons.

8
00:00:23,451 --> 00:00:25,577
Search for a course by name or code

9
00:00:25,677 --> 00:00:28,350
and expand the lesson you want to study.

10
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,898
Read the content and save your notes.

11
00:00:31,998 --> 00:00:34,367
You can also use study cards

12
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:36,350
or print the lesson as a PDF.

13
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:40,443
Answer the question and select Check
answer.

14
00:00:40,543 --> 00:00:43,440
A correct answer marks the lesson as
complete.

15
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,350
Check your progress in My progress.

16
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:48,681
Progress is saved on this device

17
00:00:48,781 --> 00:00:51,542
and can sync when you sign in with a
connection.

18
00:00:51,642 --> 00:00:54,350
Your personal notes stay in this browser.

19
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:58,727
In Memberships, explore START, PLUS and
PREMIUM.

20
00:00:58,827 --> 00:01:01,391
Online enrollment and payments

21
00:01:01,491 --> 00:01:03,350
are not enabled yet.

22
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:07,919
In Certificates, you will find the sample
design.

23
00:01:08,019 --> 00:01:10,438
Automatic certificate issuance

24
00:01:10,538 --> 00:01:13,350
and verification are not enabled yet.

25
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:17,298
Choose Spanish or English with the
selector.

26
00:01:17,398 --> 00:01:19,083
Start your next lesson.

27
00:01:19,183 --> 00:01:21,350
Your future begins with knowledge.
